---
ns: about
aboutImageFraming: null
---
{% from "ui/macros.njk" import icon, bloomMark %}
<header class="page-head about-head" data-tint>
  {% include "shell/header.njk" %}
  <div class="page-head__body wrap wrap--narrow" data-intro>
    <h1 class="page-head__title t-title"><span>For the moments </span><span>that stay</span></h1>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="about-rule wrap wrap--narrow" data-tint data-intro>
  <span class="rule"></span>
  <span class="about-rule__orb" data-turn-on-scroll>{{ bloomMark() }}</span>
</div>
<section class="about-story section" data-tint>
  <div class="wrap about-story__grid" data-intro>
    <div class="about-story__text" data-parallax="-1">
      <span class="about-story__arrow" data-turn="0,60">{{ icon('arrow') }}</span>
      <p>What stays with me in Bloom Into You is the time it gives its characters to be uncertain. Affection does not arrive in the same shape for everyone. A person can want to be close and still be afraid of what closeness asks of them.</p>
      <p><span class="about-story__aside">So this site keeps a few images and follows a few questions. It leaves space for looking again</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-story__portrait">
      <img src="/assets/img/studio-04.jpg" alt="" width="2832" height="4008" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-parallax="-2"{{ aboutImageFraming | framingAttr('object') | safe }}>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="about-essay section" data-tint>
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <article class="about-essay__article" id="ramblings" aria-labelledby="ramblings-title">
      <h2 id="ramblings-title" class="t-heading">{{ aboutEssay.title }}</h2>
      {%- for paragraph in aboutEssay.paragraphs %}
      <p>{% for part in paragraph %}{% if part.emphasis %}<strong>{{ part.text }}</strong>{% else %}{{ part.text }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
      {%- endfor %}
      <small class="quotation-source">{{ quotationSources.englishLabel }} <a href="{{ quotationSources.englishUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-barba-prevent>{{ quotationSources.englishCitation }}</a></small>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="about-scope section" data-tint>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="about-scope__title t-heading">What lives here <span class="ellipsis" aria-hidden="true"><i>.</i><i>.</i><i>.</i></span></h2>
    <div class="about-scope__grid">
      {%- set scope = [
        ['01', 'Content', 'Selected images, three character readings, and two notes on closeness. The readings follow the complete manga; character and insight pages include ending spoilers.'],
        ['02', 'Sources', 'Based on the manga by Nio Nakatani and its TV adaptation by TROYCA. This collection includes animation stills and illustrations; individual image credits are being compiled.'],
        ['03', 'Credits', "An unofficial personal collection. The story and its images belong to their respective creators. The layout and motion are inspired by contemporary portfolio websites."]
      ] %}
      {%- for item in scope %}
      <div class="about-scope__item" data-reveal="fade">
        <p class="t-label">{{ item[0] }}</p>
        <span class="rule" data-reveal="line"></span>
        <h3 class="t-lead">{% if loop.last %}{{ bloomMark('bloom-mark--inline') }}{% endif %}{{ item[1] }}</h3>
        <p class="t-note">{{ item[2] }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "shell/page-end.njk" %}
